VMD visualization helper for dynamic bonds
==========================================

There are two versions, a pure tcl one (requires vmd compiled with zlib),
and a C shared library one. daemon.tcl selects whichever is available.
If using the C shared library one, it must be loaded first with the tcl
command `load`.

For usage, see /examples/*/vis.tcl in the repository.

Compiling the shared library
-----------------------------

1. Build dependencies: pkg-config, gcc, tcl 8.6 headers, zlib headers
2. Run ./compile.sh
